1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,196
Pinjam baloknya.

2
00:00:01,437 --> 00:00:02,565
Tiga tahun kukembalikan.

3
00:00:02,637 --> 00:00:04,048
Kalau leluhur marah,

4
00:00:04,112 --> 00:00:06,538
salahkan aku si tua.

5
00:00:06,621 --> 00:00:08,342
Tali sudah terpasang.

6
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:09,326
Semua mundur!

7
00:00:09,385 --> 00:00:10,662
Baloknya turun!

8
00:00:15,886 --> 00:00:16,835
Kak Xu, kuat?

9
00:00:19,429 --> 00:00:20,957
Misi kekeringan:

10
00:00:21,029 --> 00:00:22,788
Sisa tujuh hari.

11
00:00:22,865 --> 00:00:24,091
Tujuh hari?

12
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:25,765
Kincir sebesar ini,

13
00:00:25,829 --> 00:00:27,819
tujuh hari nggak jadi.

14
00:00:27,897 --> 00:00:28,417
Bisa.

15
00:00:29,151 --> 00:00:30,565
Kau pimpin orang, aku gambar.

16
00:00:30,792 --> 00:00:32,050
Kalau gagal,

17
00:00:32,117 --> 00:00:33,216
kau tanggung baloknya.

18
00:00:33,673 --> 00:00:35,014
Semua lelaki desa,

19
00:00:35,072 --> 00:00:36,488
tiga regu!

20
00:00:36,548 --> 00:00:38,597
Satu kerja, dua tidur,

21
00:00:38,673 --> 00:00:40,747
bergilir, jangan berhenti.

22
00:00:41,028 --> 00:00:42,021
Gula dari dapur gula,

23
00:00:42,083 --> 00:00:43,606
ditukar lima belas kilo paku.

24
00:00:43,687 --> 00:00:44,660
Paku bagus.

25
00:00:44,887 --> 00:00:46,724
Bongkar rumah leluhur,

26
00:00:46,805 --> 00:00:48,250
kena kutukan langit!

27
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,988
Leluhur saja sudah dibuang,

28
00:00:51,075 --> 00:00:53,244
Liuxi bakal punah, lho.

29
00:00:55,159 --> 00:00:56,324
Kutukan langit…

30
00:00:56,388 --> 00:00:57,612
Masih jadi dibongkar?

31
00:00:58,524 --> 00:01:00,358
Leluhur juga haus!

32
00:01:00,427 --> 00:01:01,367
Kalau air datang,

33
00:01:01,427 --> 00:01:03,345
leluhur minum duluan!

34
00:01:03,411 --> 00:01:06,141
Haha, leluhur minum duluan!

35
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:10,338
Tertawalah.

36
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:14,166
Hari kesepuluh, lihat siapa yang menangis.

37
00:01:16,208 --> 00:01:16,752
Regu dua,

38
00:01:16,984 --> 00:01:17,730
ganti!

39
00:01:17,784 --> 00:01:20,011
Bilahnya miring tiga derajat,

40
00:01:20,082 --> 00:01:20,669
buat begini.

41
00:01:21,007 --> 00:01:21,945
Satu orang satu,

42
00:01:22,001 --> 00:01:23,125
biar kuat kerja!

43
00:01:23,502 --> 00:01:24,908
Pasak terakhir.

44
00:01:27,705 --> 00:01:28,642
Rangkanya berdiri.

45
00:01:28,697 --> 00:01:30,838
Muter atau nggak, lihat siang.

46
00:01:31,148 --> 00:01:32,709
Misi kekeringan:

47
00:01:32,771 --> 00:01:34,747
jatuh tempo hari ini.

48
00:01:34,826 --> 00:01:36,386
Buka pintu air.

49
00:01:36,452 --> 00:01:37,362
Erniu, tarik!

50
00:01:42,052 --> 00:01:43,053
Muter…

51
00:01:43,781 --> 00:01:44,701
Berhenti…

52
00:01:47,294 --> 00:01:49,374
Hahahaha!

53
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:51,981
Balok tujuh hari, muter setengah!

54
00:01:52,059 --> 00:01:55,728
Langit pun nggak menolongmu!
